Database migration repository (Flask-Migrate / Alembic).

Usage:
  flask db migrate -m "description"   # Auto-generate migration from model changes
  flask db upgrade                     # Apply pending migrations
  flask db downgrade                   # Revert the last migration
  flask db history                     # Show migration history

Legacy SQL files (add_performance_indexes.sql, add_tier_columns.sql) are
retained for reference but are superseded by the versioned migrations in
versions/.
